# The Hinterlands - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns and plans whose SOURCE is physically in the
# Hinterlands, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Eight recipes are vendor-sold by in-zone
# vendors (two are sole-vendor-everywhere stock); seven drop each from
# in-zone mobs (six sole-droppers found nowhere else in the data, one
# three-zone wildkin/troll/ogre family). Recipes sold only by Horde-faction
# vendors are excluded (Alterac precedent - see
# docs/hinterlands-companions-inventory.md), every other Hinterlands-dropping
# recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records carry no
# reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are
# excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated
# to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Fishing and First Aid
# have no Hinterlands source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/the-hinterlands-recipes
title The Hinterlands - Recipes
levels 38-51
zone The Hinterlands
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords hinterlands, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Aerie Peak - Nioma's pattern (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1425

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 8160 -- Nioma (13.3,43.37)
  buy 8409 "Pattern: Nightscape Shoulders"
  note Nioma (Alliance) sells the pattern at Aerie Peak (also sold by one vendor elsewhere). Stock class unconfirmed.

