step Qujo's camp - the fish recipes (Cooking)

  zone map 1425

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 270780 -- Qujo (77.95,77.83)
  buy 21099 "Recipe: Smoked Sagefish"
  buy 21219 "Recipe: Sagefish Delight"
  note Qujo (neutral) sells both fish recipes at his east-coast camp. Both are widely sold elsewhere (two dozen vendors); the Horde vendor Otho Moji'ko's stock of the same two is excluded by the Alterac precedent. Stock class unconfirmed.

step Vilebranch Witch Doctor - the mender's recipe (Alchemy)

  zone map 1425

  when skill Alchemy 1

  loop
  goto 47.56,69.49
  goto 63.27,60.03
  goto 63.75,59.94
  goto 65.86,68.58
  goto 67.33,66.35
  goto 67.35,68.72
  goto 67.7,66.01
  goto 68.52,70.25
  goto 68.94,69.37
  kill 2640 optional
  collect 250992 "Recipe: Superior Mender's Potion" optional
  collect 9294 "Recipe: Wildvine Potion" optional
  note The Vilebranch Witch Doctor (level 46) is the sole dropper of the Mender's recipe anywhere in the data, and a member of the in-zone wildkin/troll family that shares the Wildvine Potion table (also on the Stranglethorn and Arathi maps). No quest takes either recipe in the data. Profession follows the Recipe-plus-potion naming convention.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

