step Professions with no Hinterlands source

  zone map 1425

  note Fishing and First Aid have no Hinterlands source in the data: no in-zone vendor sells either profession's recipes, and no in-zone mob drops them as zone-exclusive or narrow stock. Polestar's own profession guides cover those progressions.
